  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T04:53:17.109414Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T05:02:35.290945Z",
  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "614a63ac9e1bd2da",
      "translationZh": "所以 jev 这玩意儿的动静越来越大了……说实话，感觉它被炒作得太过头了，但事情就是这样。不是说它不好，只是感觉我们往往忽略了更大的事情……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b1f8a9246affcba",
      "translationZh": "总之，来说说这篇帖子的重点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48a89e375d8a8498",
      "translationZh": "我一直在尝试用普通的开放权重 LLM 搭建一个简单的、类似 Jev 的推理方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8b1397f72ea5272",
      "translationZh": "我以前就用 llms 做过类似 jev 的东西，从来没觉得我们必须为此专门弄一套“系统一模型”，llms 就能做得不错。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12582d0ffe06b31d",
      "translationZh": "所以我稍微折腾了一下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9d5a351aa2d149e",
      "translationZh": "与 OpenJev 的主要区别在于，没有 NLI 微调，也没有分类器头。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3d1da57385e6d51",
      "translationZh": "对于每个候选答案，我都把问题转化为一次布尔验证：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1480486af9a3a0d",
      "translationZh": "然后，我不生成任何内容，而是分别读取每个候选答案的 true/false logits，对每个候选答案的这两个值做减法，再对这些分数做 softmax。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38316fc9346a1590",
      "translationZh": "所以，3 个候选项就对应 3 个差值，再对这些差值做 softmax。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0aa8e1d7413ea8c1",
      "translationZh": "计算开销大的状态/问题/选项前缀只需计算一次，然后将各个候选分支（差别仅在最后几个 token）通过 llama.cpp 批量处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8909aa7b793801d",
      "translationZh": "在一个包含 32,235 个样例的基准测试上：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2ea029fdd6f7d87",
      "translationZh": "这个 req/s 是在一台配备 5090 24gb 的笔记本电脑上测得的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f47842523dc12a7",
      "translationZh": "有意思的是，这种方法在完全未经修改的模型上也表现得出奇地好。结果发现，同一个模型的表现可以超过 openjev 的微调版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10906184efb4b8c5",
      "translationZh": "我并不是声称这复现了 Jev，也不是说这个基准测试的对比完全同等公平；我主要感兴趣的是，不训练任何东西，只是有效地调整提示词，究竟能做到什么程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2bb7123148d7f1b",
      "translationZh": "来看看，提提反馈，再做些酷炫的东西吧 :)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37aa9a1fc6fca345",
      "translationZh": "补充：我忘了说，哈哈。这个仓库是一个 rust Web 服务器，提供兼容 jev 的 API，让你可以按 jev 的方式在本地运行来自 HF 的 ggufs。还包含了几个模型的基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "418bf9fc48494cc6",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Malfeitor1235 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
